OL,3,GNEWSARoad sign blunder sends drivers to
OL,4,ABolton and Zurich
OL,5,
OL,6,FMisspelt road signs have been diverting
OL,7,Fdrivers in Derbyshire 70 miles north to
OL,8,FEgerton in Bolton and to the Swiss
OL,9,Fproduction company, Hillton, based in
OL,10,FZurich.
OL,12,FThe temporary signs near the A38 were
OL,13,Fintended to direct traffic to nearby
OL,14,FHilton and Egginton - and South
OL,15,FDerbyshire district councillor Grahame
OL,16,FAndrew said this was the second time
OL,17,FNational Highways had made the error.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
