OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSARoad sign blunder sends drivers to
OL,4,ABolton and Zurich
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In October last year, exactly the same
OL,7,Fsigns were all over the village and it
OL,8,Fwas pointed out to National Highways
OL,9,Fbut they don't seem to have done a
OL,10,Fawful lot about it," he said.
OL,12,FNational Highways apologised for the
OL,13,Fmisspelling and said the signs would be
OL,14,Freplaced.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
